  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp; (using equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math>)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>11</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>11</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>11</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>23</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;(using the identity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mrow><mo>&#8721;</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></munderover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mi>n</mi></mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mstyle></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math>)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>505</mn></math></p><p>Comparing with the given condition in question, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>505</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>505</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>303</mn></math>.</p>",
